      "Worker \u2014 `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` \uC5D0 `http://bgnj.net`, `http://www.bgnj.net`, `http://scoutkorea-jimmy.github.io` \uCD94\uAC00. HTTPS \uB3C4\uC785 \uD6C4 \uC81C\uAC70 \uAD8C\uC7A5.",
